# longitudinal_AST - ALLOWLIST. Everything is ignored unless it is listed here.
#
# Patient data are not shareable (IRB). They live in data/ and never leave it.
# Fitted models (*.rds: brms fits store the data they were fitted to),
# R workspaces, patient-level outputs, slides and posters stay local.
# To publish something new, add a "!" line for it below - never remove a rule
# from the final block.

/*

# ---- code ------------------------------------------------------------------
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/run_pipeline.sh
!/analytical_data_prep.R
!/data_inspection_summary.R
!/AMR_common.R
!/AMR_pipeline.R
!/AMR_sir_ordinal.R
!/AMR_msccm_ecology.R
!/AMR_figures_manuscript.R
!/analyses/

# ---- data folder: its README only ------------------------------------------
!/data/
/data/*
!/data/README.md

# ---- figures: the manuscript set, under manuscript numbers -----------------
!/figures/
/figures/*
!/figures/submission/

# ---- results: the numbers behind figures and tables ------------------------
!/results/
/results/*
!/results/manuscript/
!/results/deep/
!/results/reliability_split/
!/results/sir_matrix/
!/results/pseudo_trajectories/
!/results/deep_downsampling/
!/results/design_estimand/
!/results/power_recalibrated/
!/results/calendar/

# ---- never, wherever they are (last, so these win) -------------------------
*.rds
*.rda
*.RData
.Rhistory
.Rproj.user/
*.xlsx
*.docx
*.tiff
*.tif
.DS_Store
Rplots.pdf
*per_patient*
*crosswalk*
/results/manuscript/manuscript_numbers.*
